{
 "about": "The licence ledger's own rows (docs/ui.md, \"The licence ledger and Acknowledgements\"; docs/plan.md slices 18, 19 and 35): the fonts, the licence texts shipped beside them, the voice's takes (`voice`: the row's facts; its files are every take tools/voice/clips.json names), Pluxia's own bundled art (`ownArt`), other owners' marks shown as their brand rules allow (`marks`: each row's `note` holds the rules) and the own art drawn as SVG (`art`: each contract/design/art/*.svg with the day it entered this repository and its maker; tools/ledger.py gives a new SVG its row, dated the day git first saw it or else today, and drops the row of one that is gone, and LEDGER.md shows each file's current sha256). The sounds' rows come from contract/design/sound/sounds.json and receipts.json, the move figures' from contract/figures/figures.json and QuestPump_FigArmor/pack.json, the app icons' from contract/design/icons.json (tools/icons.py and tools/helper-icons.py, which replaced the placeholder icons' rows in slice 35); tools/ledger.py joins them into LEDGER.md and writes the Acknowledgements page's contract/design/acknowledgements.json, and its --check finds every font, sound, voice take, image, film and icon in the shipped roots (the apps' sources with Android's drawable and mipmap XML, helper/dist, helper/src-tauri/icons, site/public and what tauri.conf.json bundles), counts a byte-for-byte copy of a listed file (a font beside the desktop app's or the site's pages) under its original's row, and fails on one without a row or with another digest, on an SVG without a row, on any CC BY licence, on own art shipped where its notice is missing and on a stale LEDGER.md or acknowledgements.json. Each font file is byte-identical to google/fonts at the commit in its download URL (read 2026-10-03; the Barlow faces of design v3 on 2026-10-04); the dates are the days each copy entered this repository.",
